<!-- deposit.wxml -->
<view class="container">
  <view class="deposit-form">
    <text class="title">缴纳保证金</text>
    
    <view class="card">
      <view class="item-info">
        <text class="item-label">拍卖品</text>
        <text class="item-value">{{auctionItem.title || '加载中...'}}</text>
      </view>
      
      <view class="item-info">
        <text class="item-label">保证金金额</text>
        <text class="item-value price"><text class="price-symbol">¥</text>{{auctionItem.deposit_amount || '0.00'}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    
    <text class="deposit-tip">
      温馨提示：缴纳保证金后，若竞拍成功，保证金将转为部分价款；若竞拍失败，保证金将在拍卖结束后退还。
    </text>
    
    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="payDeposit" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">确认缴纳</button>
  </view>
</view>